Subject: [PATCH 4027/5749] fix(openclaw): harden reply listener process
 lifecycle

---
 src/openclaw/reply-listener-log.ts     | 55 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/openclaw/reply-listener-process.ts | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/openclaw/reply-listener-spawn.ts   | 25 +++++++++
 3 files changed, 158 insertions(+)
